{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_42", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": 74, "width": 1048, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1982966163, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1526706730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_43", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 721762279, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 502922617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - A LEAD WRITES IN", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - A LEAD WRITES IN", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_44", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": 126, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2120395275, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 253207297, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Web form, Instagram DM or Facebook DM all land on one webhook, get cleaned into the same shape, and are saved in Supabase before anything\nelse runs.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Web form, Instagram DM or Facebook DM all land on one webhook, get cleaned into the same shape, and are saved in Supabase before anything\nelse runs.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_45", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1144, "y": 74, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 937195260, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1234510746, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_46", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": 90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 555512016, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1063497604, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - INSTANT ALERT AND FIRST REPLY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - INSTANT ALERT AND FIRST REPLY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_47", "type": "text", "x": 1166, "y": 126, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1708957521, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1679116189, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The team hears about the lead in Slack, and the lead gets a WhatsApp reply with a booking\nlink, both within seconds of writing in.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The team hears about the lead in Slack, and the lead gets a WhatsApp reply with a booking\nlink, both within seconds of writing in.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_48", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2042, "y": -10, "width": 1396, "height": 458, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2132480061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 346094056, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_49", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": 6, "width": 1352, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 714537755, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1929245187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - FOLLOW UP UNTIL BOOKED", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - FOLLOW UP UNTIL BOOKED", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_50", "type": "text", "x": 2064, "y": 42, "width": 1352, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1725048951, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1193309984, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "One day later it checks Supabase. Booked or replied means confirm and put it on the calendar. Silence means a gentle nudge, wait two days, check again.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "One day later it checks Supabase. Booked or replied means confirm and put it on the calendar. Silence means a gentle nudge, wait two days, check again.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_51", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3638, "y": -90, "width": 1540, "height": 698, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 588093311, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1849076401, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_52", "type": "text", "x": 3660, "y": -74, "width": 1496, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1195809358, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1783684942, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - WHEN THEY REPLY ON WHATSAPP", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - WHEN THEY REPLY ON WHATSAPP", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_53", "type": "text", "x": 3660, "y": -38, "width": 1496, "height": 16, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1540910401, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1633982922, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Twilio posts the inbound message back in. The model reads it and routes it: book the time, hand a real question to a human, or stop messaging them for good.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Twilio posts the inbound message back in. The model reads it and routes it: book the time, hand a real question to a human, or stop messaging them for good.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_54", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5378, "y": 74, "width": 700, "height": 234, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8fd0d8", "backgroundColor": "#e4f7f9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 991070208, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 648200382, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_55", "type": "text", "x": 5400, "y": 90, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0e5f6a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 356416555, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 756849393, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5 - NOTHING FAILS QUIETLY", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_56", "type": "text", "x": 5400, "y": 126, "width": 656, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 649821630, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 996247159, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "If any step in the flow errors, Slack gets the lead, the step and a link to the failed run,\nso a silent break never costs a booking.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "If any step in the flow errors, Slack gets the lead, the step and a link to the failed run,\nso a silent break never costs a booking.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 188, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_57"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 211.25, "width": 256, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - New Lead Writes In From\nWeb Form, IG or FB DM", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText": "1 - New Lead Writes In From\nWeb Form, IG or FB DM", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 280, "y": 188, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,